.git
**/*.py[cod]
docs
plans

# Dependencies are installed from the lockfile inside the image. Copying the
# host tree in would overwrite that install with whatever the developer happens
# to have, and platform-specific binaries built for the host would not run.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Secrets. `.?env` is a single-character wildcard, so it matches `.venv` but not
# `.env` or `.env.local`; those need rules of their own or they are copied into a
# build layer and stay in the image history even if a later layer deletes them.
# The example file is re-included because it holds placeholders, not values.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.?env

# Build output and caches. Stale artifacts from a host build otherwise shadow
# what the image builds for itself.
**/.next
**/storybook-static
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo
